  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with Nan's special seasoning, salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the sweet potato between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66d7b9d0b236b2c399e277bc-1d67a25e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain sweetcorn.\n• Drain and rinse red kidney beans.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66d7b9d0b236b2c399e277bc-c165e300.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Scoop out avocado flesh into a medium bowl, then roughly mash. Add a good squeeze of lemon juice and a drizzle of olive oil. Stir until smooth and well combined. Season to taste. Set aside.\n• Finely chop tomato, then transfer to a second medium bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66d7b9d0b236b2c399e277bc-5f9d9091.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn kernels, tossing, until charred, 4-5 minutes.\n• Transfer corn to the bowl with the tomato. Add a squeeze of lemon juice. Season, then toss to combine. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid or foil if the kernels are popping\" out.\"",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66d7b9d0b236b2c399e277bc-634d660b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• SPICY! You may find the spice blend hot. Add less if you're sensitive to heat. Return pan to a medium heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook red kidney beans and Mexican Fiesta spice blend (see ingredients), stirring, until coated and fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add enchilada sauce, a splash of water and the brown sugar. Simmer until heated through, 2 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66d7b9d0b236b2c399e277bc-780b8434.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Mexican beans and roasted sweet potato between bowls.\n• Top with guac, light sour cream and charred corn salsa.\n• Crumble over fetta cubes. Sprinkle over Cheddar cheese. Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66d7b9d0b236b2c399e277bc-b0b0f3cc.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
